  "notes": [
    "Every one of the 50 wallet clones the anchor re-initialised is a target (41 clones of master 0x10d0e975, 9 of identical-code masters); each was vulnerable from its creation, so the youngest clone's creation sets the age (rules 6, 9).",
    "TEL is valued at what was realised (rule 12): the attacker's 1,325,656 MATIC and 37.51 ETH (via 319M TEL bridged to Ethereum), 0x092d6b3e's 1,288,711.81 USDT, and the smaller copycats' 58.1M TEL at the recovered $0.00145.",
    "The copycat bundle comes from TEL Transfer logs out of clones in blocks 51,540,000-51,620,000 (no clone drains after 51,572,165); wallets moved through their own 0x9d55b53f execute path are normal use and excluded."
  ],
